      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Why Circular Linked Lists?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Imagine you are playing songs from a playlist. The songs in the playlist are organized like a chain using a linked list."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Each song becomes a node in the list, and they're connected in the order they play."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "Linear Playlist ",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Once you reach the last song, the playlist will stop. But what if you want to keep the music playing in a loop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "With a regular linked list, you'd need to start from the beginning to replay the first song after the last one."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "But there's a simpler solution—the circular linked list."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In a circular linked list, the next pointer of the last song points back to the first song, creating a closed loop. This allows us to play songs continuously."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "Circular Playlist",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Circular linked lists have uses beyond music."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "So, let's learn about them in greater detail."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "But before that, let's go through a couple of quizzes."
    },
    {
